  <item>
    <title>EP.05 收好这份备考攻略，上岸so easy~</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66dd9882ee04007d88028280</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66dd9882ee04007d88028280</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Sep 2024 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>许多小伙伴都被“考试”和“</span><strong><span>备考</span></strong><span>”中大大小小的问题困扰着，非常迷茫。</span><strong><span>别怕，博士学姐来帮你！</span></strong><span>本期节目，瑞叶做为一个小小的考试达人，在经历过非常多次考试，也辅导过很多学生考试之后，将她珍藏的考试备考经验分享给大家。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目非常干货，希望大家能收获满满，成功上岸！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>一、备考前的准备工作</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="97">01:37</a> 第一步：认识你自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="411">06:51</a> 第二步：认识你的考试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="752">12:32</a> 第三步：搜集资料——打破信息差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="828">13:48</a> 第四步：关于报课：报线下机构还是网课？有没有必要花钱报？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1432">23:52</a> 第五步：确定好自己的目标分数——做到心中有数</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1633">27:13</a> 第六步：做大致的学习计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1751">29:11</a> 第七步：提前准备好适合自己的学习环境，找一个学习搭子也是可以的哦～</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>二、正式进入学习前的心态和学习观念问题</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1928">32:08</a> 什么是学习？学习的两个步骤——学习新知识和习得新知识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2562">42:42</a> 学习的动力和积极性怎么激发出来？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2898">48:18</a> 备考中感觉很焦虑怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3237">53:57</a> 学习其实是去学不会的内容，而不是重复学习已经会的内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3288">54:48</a> 学习的时候老是拖延怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3490">58:10</a> 考试目标需要合理预估</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3562">59:22</a> 备考中需要避免的侥幸心理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3718">61:58</a> 警惕形式主义陷阱，千万不能本末倒置</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>三、正式备考阶段</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3754">62:34</a> 具体的学习计划怎么做？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3947">65:47</a> 备考中产生懈怠情绪了怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4280">71:20</a> 如果落后计划，behind schedule了怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4465">74:25</a> 如何复盘错题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4635">77:15</a> 临考的时候心态崩盘不想考了怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4708">78:28</a> 面试时看到考官就紧张怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>四、考试过程中想要提醒大家的</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5044">84:04</a> 好好休息，学会给自己积极的心理暗示</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5075">84:35</a> 准备证件、看好考试流程和考试地点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5102">85:02</a> 考试后，及时分析原因</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>五、最后寄语</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5148">85:48</a> 送给大家的一段话，祝大家备考顺利，考试成功！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎶本期 Bgm:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jiggy boogy - Study Group</span></p><span></span><p><span>Fight Song-Rachel Platten</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpzr58_eXqrD-E6LBo7dWO-nLNBT.m4a" length="84452945" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:27:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvnSc3o6g0doxJLctS252AEWx1PM.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP.04 从“心”出发，答案永远在路上</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66cc79c656bfd3907a3a483c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66cc79c656bfd3907a3a483c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 Aug 2024 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>作为两个感知力很强的infj，我们经常会在平凡的生活里产生很多的小感悟。但是这些小感悟也不太方便做一期节目，所以决定以月度杂谈的方式分享给大家。</span></h2><span></span><p><span>这个月我们的关键词是：</span><strong><span>在路上</span></strong><span>👣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> 旅行路上——见旧识的欣喜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lm2snI-FUF7Ocfb7YBKfIRJjFYhR.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnmGPZpRA-njgv-zl5Ly_EXFQZYt.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuUAnwWdcC7X7Ac7t99GwmEI3vYc.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgDRo53Fi2hd1dDAp5HAcKHbtiAM.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loocS-0DsZb_EaV3-ZSpcWS6SFif.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luj--75n3dYTCCi0oAxQdb5HpZ9Q.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">27:55</a> 自我疗愈的路上——治愈与释怀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2075">34:35</a> 扶光驿站正在路上——我们共同的快乐回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2718">45:18</a> 自我成长在路上——八月，我们比以前又进步了一点！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3470">57:50</a> 九月展望——瑞叶要开学啦！扶光驿站也有大动作～</span></p><span></span><p><span>让我们共同开启九月的自我探索吧❤️‍🔥</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵bgm：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Angèle——Oui ou non</span></p><span></span><p><span>Angèle——Libre</span></p>]]></description>
